msgid "plugins.generic.authorContributorEditor.displayName"
msgstr "Author Contributor Editor"

msgid "plugins.generic.authorContributorEditor.description"
msgstr "Gives authors back the ability to edit the contributor list of their own submissions, as in OJS 3.3 and 3.4. In OJS 3.5 the Contributors panel is always read-only for authors, even when their user group has “Allow to edit submission metadata” enabled. This plugin only restores that permission in the interface: what decides remains the user group setting and the stage assignment, exactly as OJS core already enforces on the server."
